        "20.1 Business idea worksheet\nQuestion\tYour answer\nWhat do I know or enjoy?\t\nWhat can I do competently?\t\nWho has a problem I can solve?\t\nWhat outcome do they want?\t\nWhat service can I deliver?\t\nWhat proof do I have?\t\nWhat proof do I need?\t\nWhat is the smallest useful pilot?\t\nWhat qualifications or permissions are needed?",
