        "If you'd like to learn more, [clear call to action].\n20.6 Discovery-call questions\n1. What are you trying to achieve?\n2. What is making that difficult?\n3. What have you tried already?\n4. What happened?\n5. Why is solving this important now?\n6. What would a useful result look like?\n7. What constraints should I understand?\n8. Who is involved in the decision?\n9. What timeline are you considering?\n10. What questions do you have about the service?\n20.7 Continuation-offer worksheet\nQuestion\tAnswer\nWhat did the customer originally buy?\t\nWhat result did they achieve?\t\nWhat problem remains?\t\nWhat is their next logical goal?\t\nCan I help with it competently?\t\nWhat would the next service include?\t\nWhat is the price and delivery cost?\t\nHow will the customer decide?",
